Error [jet.MissingWriteMarker]: `.add()` changes `world`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/pool_read_only_param_mutation.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     world.add(Player{name: "Kai", hp: 100})
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on, so its receiver needs write access
 Fix: Change the parameter to `world: &Pool<Player>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202

Error [jet.MissingWriteMarker]: `.remove()` changes `world`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/pool_read_only_param_mutation.jet:14:8
    |
 14 |     _: world.remove(id)
    |        ^^^^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on, so its receiver needs write access
 Fix: Change the parameter to `world: &Pool<Player>`
